 | PATCH | `/projects/{pid}/tasks/{tid}` | `{"title"?,"status"?,"assignee"?}` → 200 |
 | DELETE | `/projects/{pid}/tasks/{tid}` | → 204 |
 
+| POST | `/projects/{pid}/members/{uid}/move` | `{"toProjectId"}` → 200 `{"userId","projectId","role"}` |
+
+`move` removes the member from `{pid}` and adds them to the destination with the
+same role. The caller must be a manager of both projects; neither may be
+archived (409), the destination must differ (400) and must not already have the
+user (409). The member's tasks in the source project become unassigned.
+
 Statuses: `open`, `doing`, `done`. Errors are `{"error":"..."}`.
 
